.TH scw 1 "" "scw" "scw Manual"
.SH NAME
scw \- Scaleway command line tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscw\fP [global option ...] <command> [args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
scw is the Scaleway command line tool. It allows you to manage your Scaleway infrastructure: compute, storage, networking, databases and more.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--profile <value>, -p <value>\fP
The config profile to use
.TP
\fB--config <path>, -c <path>\fP
The path of the config file
.TP
\fB--output <format>, -o <format>\fP
Output format: json or human
.TP
\fB--debug, -D\fP
Enable debug mode
.TP
\fB--beta, -B\fP
Enable beta mode
.SH NAMESPACES
.TP
\fBdemo\fP
Demo namespace
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fISCW_ACCESS_KEY\fR
The access key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_SECRET_KEY\fR
The secret key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ORGANIZATION_ID\fR
The default organization ID (get your organization ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_PROJECT_ID\fR
The default project ID (get your project ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_REGION\fR
The default region
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ZONE\fR
The default availability zone
.TP
\fISCW_API_URL\fR
URL of the API
.TP
\fISCW_INSECURE\fR
Set this to true to enable the insecure mode
.TP
\fISCW_PROFILE\fR
Set the config profile to use